{"Title":"An Act providing for a Red Shield/Blue Shield license plate to survivors of firefighters and police officers who have died in the line of duty","BillNumber":"H3476","DocketNumber":"HD1641","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SLG1","Name":"Susannah M. Whipps","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:17:39.17"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SLG1","Name":"Susannah M. Whipps","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:17:39.17"},{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T09:58:32.2866667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3476/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Whipps of Athol, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3476) of Susannah M. Whipps and Vanna Howard relative to providing for a red shield/blue shield license plate to survivors of firefighters and police officers who died in the line of duty.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 2 of Chapter 90 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2014 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting, after paragraph twenty, the following paragraph:-\r\n\tThe registrar shall furnish without charge to the owner of a private passenger motor vehicle who is a parent, child, sibling, grandchild or spouse of a paid professional firefighter or call firefighter or police officer or reserve police officer who has died in the line-of-duty, upon presentation of satisfactory evidence of such status as determined by the registrar, a distinctive license plate bearing a design approved by the Registrar.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}